add(594, '器械 · 坐地撑杆后仰', '坐在地上，双臂向后撑住立杆把身体撑开，躯干后仰双腿前伸', 'seated on the floor with both arms braced behind against a vertical pole, the chest opened and the torso leaning back with the legs extended forward')
